---
// 品牌命名故事：Joule × Polaris
---

<section class="section section-alt" id="brand-story">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div class="story-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="story-g" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="var(--c-green-deep)" />
              <stop offset="0.5" stop-color="var(--c-teal)" />
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--c-blue)" />
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="78" fill="none" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 6" />
          <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="56" fill="none" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1" />
          <path d="M100 30 L112 88 L170 100 L112 112 L100 170 L88 112 L30 100 L88 88 Z" fill="url(#story-g)" opacity="0.92" />
          <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="10" fill="var(--surface)" />
          <path d="M104 92 97 103h5l-2 9 9-12h-5l2-8z" fill="var(--c-green-deep)" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Brand Story</span>
        <h2>Joule × Polaris —— 能源的指北星</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>JOULARIS</strong> 由 <strong>Joule</strong>（焦耳，能量的單位）與
          <strong>Polaris</strong>（北極星，指引方向）組成。
        </p>
        <p>
          工廠裡的用電、用水、用氣數據又多又雜。JOULARIS
          想扮演的，是替你在這些數據裡指出方向的角色：哪裡浪費最多、哪裡最值得先改善，都有數據可以佐證。
        </p>
        <p class="en-tagline">Your compass for energy efficiency.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .story-visual svg {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .en-tagline {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--c-green-deep);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .story-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .story-visual {
      max-width: 200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
